    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Thomas Byrne Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market this excellent mid-terraced property just off Duleek Street, on Drogheda's southside.\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation comprises: Entrance Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen, 3 Bedrooms and Bathroom. There is natural gas heating, and the windows are double glazed PVC. There is a driveway to the front and an extra-long garden to the rear.\n\nPriest Lane is ideally situated with every conceivable amenity positioned literally on your doorstep, such as schools, shops, restaurants etc. Just 5 minutes' walk to the town centre. Adjacent to all transport links including bus & train station and the M1 motorway is just a two-minute drive.\nViewing highly recommended\n\nFEATURES\n•3 Bedroom Mid-Terrace\n•Excellent condition throughout\n•Double Glazed windows\n•Extra-long rear garden circa 80ft\n•Driveway to front\n•Close to all local amenities.\n•On local bus route & 5 minute walk to Bus & Train Station.\n•Access to M1 motorway just a 2-minute drive\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nEntrance Hallway\n2.5m x 1.1mTimber floor\n\nSitting Room/ Dining Area \n6.7m x 3.2m\nTimber floor, TV point, Fireplace.\n\nKitchen \n5.6m x 2.3m\nFully fitted kitchen with tiled floor. \n\nBathroom\n2.3m x 1.6m\nFully tiled, walk in shower\n\nBedroom 1\n4.4m x 2.1m\nTimber floor, built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2\n3.7m x 2.3m\nTimber floor, built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom3\n2.3m x 2.0m\nTimber floor, built in bed\n"
      },
